{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"  \n  \n  \n  \n  7月ですね\n  \n  nico touches the wallsさんの\n  夏の大三角形\n  がわたしの定番のナツウタです\n  \n  \n  夏かあ\n  今はまだ梅雨ですよね\n  \n  雨の日は天気の子を観る決まりなのですが\n  天気の子を観過ぎてセリフ覚えてきました☺︎\n  \n  \n  \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFP9VA7EZM95RRVM9XYQW7N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFP9WRR868232BP7V4W25C2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFP9Y79CK3JZ7MTNMA2JY2G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFP9ZE9EDCECMEKARZ1T501","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFPA166FVX62SYH60W9YMRZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  昨日このワンピース着ていたら\n  絢音が似合うねって褒めてくれました\n  \n  髪やメイクや服の少しの変化にも気付いてくれるので\n  嬉しいんですいつも。\n  \n  \n  \n  朝ごはんは大好きなとうもろこしです\n  \n  美味しいとうもろこしと桃を\n  この夏は追い求めたいとおもいます\n  \n  \n  \n  では！☺︎\n  \n  \n  \n  "}],"source":"archive"}